[Located conveniently behind the] gear shifter[,] the Driver Preference Dial adjusts the Maloo’s ESC, Traction Control, Launch Control (manual[ transmission]) and Electric Power[ Ste]ering according to three distinct pre-set modes – Touring, Sport and Performance[.] In doing so, the vehicle’s handling characteristics instantly change.
